```Detection 1: SSH brute force | MITRE T1110 | Data: index=test sourcetype=linux_secure```
```Status: per-IP failure counts run and confirmed; the 5-minute-bucket version below not yet run```
index=test sourcetype=linux_secure "Failed password"
| rex field=_raw "Failed password for (invalid user )?(?<ssh_user>\S+) from (?<src_ip>\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)"
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count, dc(ssh_user) as unique_users by _time, src_ip
| where count > 10
| sort - count
